post_install() {
  cat <<'EOF'

x3dctl installed.

Default behavior uses the normal sudo/sudoers-based privilege model.

Optional passwordless convenience mode (extended / advanced / best effort):
  sudo setcap 'cap_sys_nice,cap_sys_admin=ep' /usr/bin/x3dctl-helper

Remove capabilities:
  sudo setcap -r /usr/bin/x3dctl-helper

This may reduce or eliminate password prompts for supported operations.
Behavior for global mode operations may vary by kernel and permission model.

See:
  man x3dctl

EOF
}

post_upgrade() {
  post_install
}
